etion if the trainer has active\nclients. This ensures client data remains associated with a valid\ntrainer at all times.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":251,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":323,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"e2d9ea40c93be882db0b24316dab03465c2562f6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"style: Fix Checkstyle errors in delete commands","messageBody":"The project\u0027s style checker is failing due to formatting issues in\nthe newly added delete commands. This prevents the CI pipeline from\npassing successfully.\n\nLet\u0027s correct the trailing whitespaces and indentation to satisfy the\nstyle requirements.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":0,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"18179698cd4a443f83c313b86e23489912233271","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #45 from prithvibhardwaj/calorie-features","messageBody":"Add set-calorie-target and log-calorie commands","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"306005a8a9ea062cb7bcd97e4fbabcfb1d433047","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Codecov badge to point to correct repo","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"46a0dd06913ff5d4d138d78577af26fa4e2f86cf","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #46 from TheSputnikSpacecraft/Update-Codecov","messageBody":"Update Codecov badge to point to correct repo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-12T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"708102b3c0bd90be2bc188f7aa0b982662614155","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"test: Improve code coverage for model and logic classes","messageBody":"Current code coverage is at 66.66%, which is below the project target.\nSeveral core components, including the Client class and various delete\nparsers, lack sufficient unit test coverage for edge cases and branch\nlogic.\n\nLet\u0027s add new test files for DeleteClientCommandParser,\nDeleteTrainerCommandParser, and the Client model. Additionally, we\u0027ll\nexpand existing tests for AddCommandParser, DeleteClientCommand, and\nDeleteTrainerCommand. These changes increase coverage to the 70-75%\nrange while ensuring functional reliability.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":454,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"acc5a1d326ba6b8fb412615ef523e9f2a6a86e74","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #54 from NotDotManish/list-trainers-command","messageBody":"Add list-trainers and list-clients commands","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-18T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"adeb4b0c2c6783323646d8e2a143c069d0d86792","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #55 from ephtale/ui-update","messageBody":"Update UI, targeted commands, and testing","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"2ba30a9104610e7b79df20fcd7688472b0bc0318","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #59 from AdibShifas/branch-SyntaxUserGuide","messageBody":"Update Help Button to show Basic Syntax","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-19T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"dc25ae0dc06c552f9f0bb692fc293ba69a21f7ce","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Commands: Implement list-clients with optional index and Codecov rules","messageBody":"The current list-clients command is incomplete as it does not clear the\nselected trainer in the UI, leading to a visual mismatch in the\ntwo-column layout. Additionally, the project lacks automated coverage\nenforcement, allowing potential regressions in test quality.\n\nLet\u0027s enhance ListClientsCommand to support an optional trainer index\nfor targeted filtering and ensure it clears the UI selection when\ncalled without arguments. This aligns the command\u0027s behavior with the\nexisting \u0027Show All\u0027 button. Furthermore, we\u0027ll add a codecov.yml\nconfiguration to set a 75% coverage target, ensuring all future\ncontributions maintain high testing standards.\n","fileTypesAndCon